<BehaviorPatch #track.r_2_0_2_6_-_0_7_-_1_8_-_1_7_0_4_-_a_d_d_-_p_r_o_v_i_d_e_r_-_r_e_q_u_e_s_t_-_s_q_l_i_t_e_-_l_e_d_g_e_r.behavior_patch.terminal-headless-runtime-cli apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" version="1" { capability = "terminal-headless-runtime-cli" } (
  <Mutations [
    <Upsert { selector = "behavior://terminal-headless-runtime-cli/requirements/provider-request-capture-option" } (
      <Requirement #provider-request-capture-option (
        <Statement ?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14S>
        `eidolon exec` SHALL 提供显式 provider request capture 选项，把当前 session 的完整请求现场写入独立 SQLite，而不改变 headless runtime 行为。
        </?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14S>
        <Suites [
          <Suite #capture-option { name = "Headless request capture option" } (
            <Cases [
              <Case #capture-disabled-by-default (
                <Given ?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14T>
                调用方未传 provider request capture 选项
                </?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14T>
                <When ?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14V>
                系统执行 headless turn
                </?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14V>
                <Then ?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14W>
                系统 SHALL NOT 创建完整 provider request SQLite ledger
                </?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14W>
              )>
              <Case #capture-to-session-ledger [
                <Then ?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14X>
                系统 SHALL 把账本写入该 session 的独立 observability SQLite 文件
                </?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14X>
                <Then ?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14Y>
                terminal SHALL 只绑定 capability、session path 和 support port，SHALL NOT 读取或组装 provider messages
                </?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14Y>
              ] (
                <Given ?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14Z>
                调用方传入 `--capture-provider-requests` 和一个持久化 session
                </?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK14Z>
                <When ?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK150>
                系统执行或恢复该 session
                </?01M05F1PKQG791JAMEMWSBK150>
              )>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    )>
  ]>
)>
